Validated facts and confirmed findings
- Response.set_cookie implementation and cookie serialization:
  - File: falcon/response.py
    - Response.set_cookie(name, value, ...) manages cookies in self._cookies via http.cookies.SimpleCookie (imported as falcon.util.http_cookies).
