Root cause analysis
- The TypeError when passing partitioned to Response.set_cookie was caused by a cythonized implementation of set_cookie that did not include the new kwarg in its compiled signature.
- Older Python versions do not natively support the 'Partitioned' flag in http.cookies.Morsel; without backporting, the attribute would not be recognized or emitted in Set-Cookie headers.
- Automatic enabling of Partitioned when SameSite=None was not present, missing current browser expectations for third-party partitioned cookies (CHIPS).

